# Forex Macro Screener 📊

A Streamlit app that shows forex pair prices, macro data (GDP/CPI), news sentiment, and a bullish/bearish signal.

## Setup

1. Deploy to Streamlit: https://share.streamlit.io
2. Add your API keys in Streamlit Secrets:
   - ALPHA_KEY
   - TE_USER
   - TE_PASS
   - NEWS_KEY
3. Run the app and view live forex signals!
